# Commit and push

When a phase or a patch is finished, commit the work and push it to `origin` without waiting to be asked.

- Remote is `git@github.com:ecakeman/AlertFlow.git`. Do not push to upstream.
- Do not force-push.
- Do not commit `ALERTFLOW_CURSOR_PLAN (1).md`.
- Leave the work uncommitted only when the user says not to commit.
